            "Zonas en el suelo (fuego, lava, veneno, esporas, telaraña, sueño, agua, energía) y niebla que solo deja ver cerca de ti.": "Floor zones (fire, lava, poison, spores, web, sleep, water, energy) and fog that only lets you see close to you.",
            "PokeIsaac se juega en horizontal.": "PokeIsaac is played in landscape.",
            COGER: "TAKE",
